				{
					"id": 732430801,
					"content": "「現在學院對於虛空的應用推廣，與其說是太激進，我看不如說是太保守了。大量教令官的工作冗繁低效，某些方面甚至還不如以前。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732430802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732430802,
					"content": "「試想，如果我們能用虛空直接給大家分配工作，交易所的商品交換也由虛空直接管理。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732430803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732430803,
					"content": "「等到那個時候，我們起碼能裁撤掉一半的教令官。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732430804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732430804,
					"content": "「你說的很有道理，所以我想或許這就是我們沒辦法這麼做的原因。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7324309,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7324309
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7324309",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7324309,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732430901,
					"content": "「眾所周知，探求深秘的智慧才是學者的本職。但現在的教令院，實在過度牽涉到行政事務當中了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732430902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732430902,
					"content": "「如今很多同學在匆匆完成學業後，就不得不停下手中的研究，被委派去各地負擔教令官的工作，這是否已經背離了教令院的初衷呢？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732430903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732430903,
					"content": "「這個問題不是早在虛空裡就已經有結論了嗎？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732430904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732430904,
					"content": "「在百姓還陷於迷信之中，唯有我們最為接近真理的光輝。我們又怎能卸下用火光照亮世人這樣的重責呢。我們要是不管的話，須彌還不知道要亂成什麼樣子呢！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7324310,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7324310
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7324310",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7324310,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732431001,
					"content": "「身為留學生，在教令院學習的每一天都讓我更加感受到樹王的偉大。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431002,
					"content": "「在蒙德的時候，再簡單的問題都要翻上十幾本書才勉強能把不同的說法整理出來。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431003,
					"content": "「但有了『虛空終端』之後，只要思考特定的內容就能獲得正確的知識。我想世上絕不會有比虛空更偉大的造物了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7324311,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7324311
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7324311",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7324311,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732431101,
					"content": "「自迦毗鳩師之後，教令院每年撥給刹訶伐羅學院的經費就沒有漲過。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431102,
					"content": "「上面的人只會說什麼為了大家穩定安寧的生活，必須嚴格控制機械技術的研發和推廣。如果要這樣說，那我看乾脆把虛空也關了算了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431103,
					"content": "「如果不是有像桑歌瑪哈巴依老爺這樣有慧眼的商人長期投資，我們妙論派早就關門大吉了！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7324312,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7324312
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7324312",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7324312,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732431201,
					"content": "「雖然我完全信任賢者和導師們的判斷，但如今的教令院是否太依賴虛空了呢。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431202,
					"content": "「習慣於透過虛空獲取知識後，我們外派出的遊學者學術能力的下降是有目共睹的。我認為有必要通過法令限制初入學的學生使用虛空。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431203,
					"content": "「怎麼能這麼說，你不知道那些隱遁沙漠之中，未能接受虛空教導的學派早已陷入無知與迷狂之中，乃至於用生吞毒蛇的愚行來接近智慧了嗎？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431204,
					"content": "「在大慈樹王身後，恰恰是虛空保證了我們知識的純潔。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7324313,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7324313
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7324313",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7324313,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732431301,
					"content": "本週由巡林官提納里大人主講的「植物學講座」將照常於禪那園舉辦，歡迎大家報名。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431302,
					"content": "不管是什麼人，只要對植物感興趣都可以來參加！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431303,
					"content": "非常抱歉，由於本次講座報名人數太多，為方便知識管理，經教令院討論決定，將僅限生論派的同學及巡林工作人員參加，特此公告。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7324314,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7324314
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7324314",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7324314,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732431401,
					"content": "「有人看了最新的八重堂小說嗎？這次有我們須彌的作者哦，好像是叫…普爾希娜什麼的吧，一看就是你們生論派的人。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431402,
					"content": "「唉…我要是當初也能考進阿彌利多學院就好了，不僅天天能遊山玩水，還有空寫小說。結果進了這個室羅婆耽，每天除了讀文獻就是寫論文，連出去考察的機會都沒有。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431403,
					"content": "「什麼，竟然有人搶在老夫之前在八重堂出版了小說，這下本人輕小說研究權威的身分豈不是…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7324315,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7324315
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7324315",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7324315,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732431501,
					"content": "「果然生意和書本上的事情是兩碼事，要是當初留在大巴扎好好做生意就好了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431502,
					"content": "「結果現在論文也寫不出來，錢也沒了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431503,
					"content": "「實在不行，乾脆退學去鍍金旅團算了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7324316,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7324316
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7324316",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7324316,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732431601,
					"content": "「不是說我對沙漠來的人有什麼意見，但是我看大風紀官還是得德高望重的學者來擔任才是，特別是學術的問題可不是靠打架能解決的。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431602,
					"content": "「呵呵，我看至少比你們明論派的人管的時候要好多了，至少不會偏袒哪個學院。真以為沒人知道你們以前每年的發表率是怎麼回事？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431603,
					"content": "「喂！妙論派的傢伙，你說話可要拿出證據，不然我可要找風紀官評理了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7324317,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7324317
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7324317",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7324317,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732431701,
					"content": "「開放其他國家的人來留學也就算了，現在連虛空也要開放給外國人…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431702,
					"content": "「且不說外國人的腦袋會不會對虛空造成什麼不好的影響，光是不可避免的知識外流問題，就不知道會對須彌的外貿經濟造成多大影響。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431703,
					"content": "「竟然有學者會關心經濟問題，還真是少見…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732431704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732431704,
					"content": "「所以說你們知論派就是不食人間煙火，要不是為了能合成出更好的漆器塗料，我才不會考來教令院呢！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "留言板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7324318,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7324318
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
